## Nix ignores:
/.direnv
/.envrc

## Hugo specific ignores:
/public
/resources
.hugo_build.lock
hugo_stats.json

## Node.js ignores:
/node_modules

## Cloudflare Wrangler local dev cache and secrets (see package.json's dev-serve script):
/.dev.vars
/.wrangler

## Favicon files (see package.json's generate:favicon script):
/static/apple-touch-icon.png
/static/favicon-96x96.png
/static/favicon.ico
/static/favicon.svg
/static/site.webmanifest
/static/web-app-manifest-192x192.png
/static/web-app-manifest-512x512.png

## Various ignores:
.DS_Store
/tmp
